DASH_TRANSCRIPT = ["Hi, my name is MTG, Your Digital Architect. Thank you for taking the time to watch this training. As promised, this is the full walkthrough of your Bellver dashboard. In the next few minutes, I'll show you where everything is, what every number means, and where to find the official company channels and documents. Let's get started.", "To log in, go to app dot bellvercards dot com, forward slash login, or tap any Login button, like the one on my guide. When you log in, Dashboard is already selected.", "At the top, you see the username you registered with. Next to it is the eye icon. Tap it to hide or show your balances across the dashboard. Tap it again to show them.", "Below that is My Rank. Mine says Member. Then My Referral Link. Tap the copy icon to copy it, and share it with your potential business partners, if you decide to take part in the matrix program. Remember, the matrix program is one hundred percent optional.", "On the right, Qualified for levels shows how many levels you qualify for. Mine is ten. Number of team members in total is still zero on this new account. And Team card top-ups this month in total shows what your team loaded onto their cards this month. These numbers grow with your team.", "On the far right, Qualification direct members lists the people who registered directly under you. Tap See all direct members for the details. Below it, Monthly qualification shows your card spending this month. Your first month is free. After that, load at least one hundred dollars onto your own card every month. Now, please don't let this scare you, like it scared me at first. This one hundred dollars is not a monthly subscription, and it's not a fee. Bellver doesn't take it from you. It stays your own money, on your own card, ready for things you already buy, like groceries, fuel, data or your bills. It simply keeps you qualified for the monthly matrix rewards.", "Now, this is important. Follow Bellver's official WhatsApp channels, so you're always updated. Tap Connect next to the English channel, and follow it. The second one is the German channel. Always follow the company's official socials, including Bellver's official YouTube channel. Can't find them? Ask me, or the business partner who shared this video with you.", "Now the first block: Current balance in my Dynamic Wallet. This is the wallet you created and secured in Tutorial 3. It's provided and secured by Fireblocks, a non-custodial wallet, protected by your private key. Haven't watched Tutorial 3 yet? Watch it now. Watched it already? Watch it again, as a quick refresher.", "Commissions in 24 hours: what you earned in the last twenty four hours, still clearing. Rewards current month: your rewards for the current reward period. And Missing Rewards: rewards your card level would make you miss. Mine reads: your card already earns you every level your partners qualify you for. If anything ever shows here, the Deposit and Upgrade buttons are right there.", "Current balance on all of my cards: the total on every card you bought from Bellver. Mine is ten dollars. Lifetime Direct Commissions in total: all your cleared commissions for your personal referrals. Lifetime Rewards in total: all the rewards you ever received. And Earnings Available: the total of your earnings available for withdrawal. All these numbers update as you build your business.", "My active cards shows your cards. Mine is a Premium virtual card. More cards would show here too, and you can tap Upgrade at any time. Next, Lifetime deposits in total, and Lifetime spendings in total on all your cards. I haven't spent with my card yet, so mine shows zero. Below that, the chart shows your money in and out over the last fourteen days.", "Recent activity shows your latest moves. Tap View all to see everything. And My Cards lists every card you own, the type, virtual or physical, and the status, active or not. Tap New card to add another one.", "Now the menu on the left. My Wallet. It may ask for the security code you created. Tutorial 3 shows you how to set up everything on this page, step by step, and there's an official two minute video right here too.", "Deposit. This funds your embedded wallet, the one you hold the private key for. Tutorial 4 shows you exactly how. Receive is for funding. History shows your deposits. And Buy Crypto: to buy crypto with a card through Banxa, watch the one minute video right here in the dashboard.", "Withdraw. At the top, you see what's available to withdraw. The minimum payout is one hundred dollars. This is a different one hundred dollars. It's not the one hundred dollars you load every month, and it's not a subscription or a fee. It's simply the smallest payout you can request. Earnings by type shows your referral, upgrade and reward earnings, pending, available and forfeited. How payouts work explains it: earnings mature from pending to available, you request any amount from the minimum up to your available balance, and an admin reviews and pays it out manually. Commissions become claimable twenty four hours after the purchase. Your payout requests show at the bottom.", "My Cards. Tutorial 4 shows you how to order your card, step by step. Here you see your card and its balance, with Details, Top Up, Freeze and Settings. The Top Up button loads money onto your card. Below are your card transactions, and the steps to add your card to Apple Pay or Google Pay.", "Transactions. Every movement on your account, in one place: deposits, cards, earnings and swaps. Use the filters at the top to show only what you need.", "Statement. This is your monthly qualification cycle, the requirement for receiving any reward at all. Your first cycle is free. After that, load at least one hundred dollars onto your card each cycle, and use your card for things you already buy. Let me remind you again: this one hundred dollars is not a monthly subscription, and it's not a fee. It stays your own money, on your own card. The cycle runs from the sixteenth of one month to the fifteenth of the next. Miss a cycle, and that cycle's rewards are forfeited. Miss three in a row, and you lose your matrix position. Your direct commissions are never affected.", "Referral. Here's your username and your referral link again, another chance to copy and share it. My direct referrals lists the people who joined through your link. Levels shows your team on every level, and your rank pays rewards up to ten levels deep. Scroll down to the matrix view. Now look at this. When I recorded this video, both seats right under me, left and right, were still open. Network marketers and business builders know how much positioning matters. These top seats go to whoever takes action first. So if you're ready, you might want to move a little faster.", "Tutorials. The official dashboard has short how-to videos, like this one minute and this two minute video. You'll find many more step by step tutorials on my guide, on the Tutorial Videos page.", "Videos. You may already know the three minute and the twenty seven minute videos from my guide. Here you'll find more, like the ten minute dashboard video and the launch webinar. Watch them right here, in the official dashboard.", "News channel. This is where you'll find Bellver's official news videos, in English and in German, from the company's official YouTube channel. Follow these channels.", "PDFs. Open or download all the official company documents: the compensation plan, the price list and the presentation. Make it a habit to visit your dashboard, and go through them.", "Support. Have a question? Open a new ticket. I've written to support a few times, and they replied every time. You can even see one of my questions here, about the one hundred dollar monthly requirement. And remember, that one hundred dollars is not a subscription. It stays your own money, on your own card. Some of my tickets are already closed. Bellver support is very responsive.", "Notifications shows every update on your account, like deposits credited and your identity check.", "Settings. Tutorial 2 shows you how to secure your account here, so watch it if you haven't yet. The last item is Log Out. You can also log out from the menu at the top right, which also opens your account settings, to fix your details or reset your password.", "Quick recap. Your dashboard shows your balances, rank, referral link and team at a glance. The eye icon hides your balances. The menu takes you to your wallet, deposits, withdrawals, cards, referrals, videos and the official documents. The one hundred dollars you load every month is not a subscription: it stays your own money, on your own card. And always follow Bellver's official channels.", "Well done. Now you know your Bellver dashboard inside out. Log in regularly, check your numbers, and keep an eye on the official news. Share this video with your potential business partners, because every new cardholder deserves an easy start. Still stuck after watching a few times? Contact me, or the business partner who shared this video with you.", "Quick reminder: none of this is financial advice. Always do your own research. Thank you for tuning in, and for every like, share, and comment. Your support means everything. And thank yourself for taking massive action today to change your future! I wish you nothing but the best, because YOU are the best. I'm MTG, Your Digital Architect. See you on the next one. Let's Get This Crypto!"]
